# A search's rule judges the cards found together (CR 701.23): Brightglass Gearhulk searches for "up to two" artifact,
# creature and/or enchantment cards with mana value 1 or less, so Sol Ring, Llanowar Elves and Fastbond - each findable
# alone - are refused as one answer of three, and two of them are taken. The refusal names three findable cards, so the
# harness checks the answer against the search's own rule rather than each card alone. Black Lotus pays {G}{G} with Mox
# Pearl and a Plains paying {W}{W} on turn 1.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
